---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party notice for binary distributions
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

Binary distributions of Leyline — the prebuilt Node N-API addon (.node) and
the Python wheel — statically link BoringSSL, Google's TLS library. Modern
BoringSSL is licensed under Apache-2.0, with a BSD-3-Clause notice for
Go-derived test tooling that is not linked into the shipped libraries. The
full BoringSSL license text is preserved alongside the prebuilt libraries at
crates/leyline-bssl-sys/LICENSE-BORINGSSL in the source tree. See NOTICE for the
complete third-party attribution.
